  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Swedesurvey for contract writing in relation to the EU Twinning project &quot;Reduce Discrepancies between the Physical Reality   and the Graphical Cadastral Information in Jordan for the Department  of Lands and Survey&quot;, JO14/ENP/JH/26.</narrative>
